# Data files (large PDFs and spreadsheets) — anchored to root only.
# Without the leading slash, this would match any "data/" dir at any depth,
# including fork-only `comparanda/projects/<domain>/data/` (bundles, gold
# standard, PDFs). Anchored so forks can populate per-domain data trees.
/data/

# Source data archive

